# Build context of api/deploy/Dockerfile: keep the host's build output and local
# files out of the image layers (the SDK stage restores and builds for itself).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
# The image publishes Portfolio.Api alone: the test projects stay out, so that
# a change of a test never invalidates the layers of the image.
*.Tests/
deploy/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
